--TEST--
a cursor on an operand of a broken condition is offered Join onto one line, which puts the condition and its parentheses back on the `if` line, `rule:ide/a-list-splits-onto-lines-and-joins-onto-one`
--FILE--
<?nvs
bool $active = true;
bool $admin = false;
if (
    $active
    && $ad<|>min
) {
    echo "both";
}
--REQUEST--
codeAction
--EXPECT--
4:5-7:1 refactor.rewrite Join onto one line -> "$active && $admin"
